Package: sunfounder-tft35ips-dkms
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, device-tree-compiler
Recommends: python3-evdev, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo
Maintainer: SunFounder <service@sunfounder.com>
Description: DRM driver for the SunFounder 3.5" IPS display (ST7796S)
 DKMS source package for the sunfounder-tft35ips DRM driver, together with
 the sf-tft doctor helper and the touch calibration tool. The module is
 compiled against the running kernel at install time and rebuilt by DKMS
 after a kernel update.
